## Flags for the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/apps/erts/erl_cmd.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie come from env vars; do not set them here.

## A collector opens no distribution port and starts no epmd (its one listener,
## the status page, binds 127.0.0.1 only). Distribution is off (env.sh.eex,
## env.bat.eex), except under the Windows service, which erlsrv always runs
## as a named node. These two keep any named node from opening the
## distribution port or starting epmd: it could only connect outwards, and
## nothing in the collector does.
-dist_listen false
-start_epmd false
